t;Rotation of the Earth&quot; commission and &quot;WebmedCentral Ecology Advisory Board&quot;.</p><p class=\"bio\">In 2020, he was awarded the title of honorary professor of the Azerbaijan State Oil and Industry University, and in 2023, he was elected a foreign member of the Georgian Academy of Sciences.</p><p class=\"bio\">Professor Eppelbaum has received several awards; among them is the Christian Huygens medal of the European Geosciences Union (2019).</p><p class=\"bio\">According to Google Scholar, his scholarly publications have been cited nearly 8,000 times.</p>",
