&quot; gold medal (&quot;Birlik&quot;), 2018</li><li>&quot;Kind Mother&quot; gold medal, Dede Gorgud Foundation of the Republic of Azerbaijan, 2019</li><li>25th anniversary medal of the People&#x27;s Assembly of Kazakhstan, 2020</li><li>&quot;Meirim&quot; badge of the People&#x27;s Assembly of Kazakhstan (&quot;Мейирим&quot;), 2020</li><li>For his activities in the field of international relations and diaspora, he was awarded the medal of the Republic of Azerbaijan &quot;For services in diaspora activities&quot; in 2024</li><li>30th anniversary medal of the People&#x27;s Assembly of Kazakhstan, 2025</li></ul></div>",
