\">In 2017, he was elected Honorary Academician of the Russian Academy of Arts.</p><p class=\"bio\">In 2020, he was given the academic title and authority of &quot;professor&quot; by the Board of Directors of Yeditepe University of the Republic of Turkey.</p><p class=\"bio\">In 2022, he was awarded a special medal for his services to the Azerbaijani Diaspora.</p><p class=\"bio\">In 2022, he was elected a member of the Coordinating Council of Azerbaijanis Living Abroad under the chairmanship of the President of the Republic of Azerbaijan Mr. Ilham Aliyev.</p><p class=\"bio\">In 2024, he was elected a member of the Board of the World Union of Azerbaijani Scientists.</p>",
